      "type": "text",
      "title": "Living with it",
      "text": [
        "Right-click it to see what it last struck. A lever silences it.",
        "It is a guard, not a farm: one strike a second will not keep up with a spawner. If the deaths should pay you back, set a [Wake Bell](wake_bell) within 16 blocks of where they fall.",
        "A Hush Totem stops hostiles spawning inside camp; the Ward Drum deals with the ones that walk in from outside."
